# Used by `selftest=console-input`: the reader (arg 2 = HELLO_WAIT_INPUT)
# waits until the console has received a line on the serial port, which
# reaches the console as IRQ 4.
#
# name      image         priority  provides  uses      devices  quota  arg
console     console.elf   200       console   -         com1     -      0
reader      hello.elf     100       -         console   -        -      2